{"id":"s15","label":"15. Margaret’s Room","blocks":[{"k":"s","text":"MARGARET"},{"k":"d","text":"at the spinning-wheel, alone"},{"k":"v","lines":["My peace is gone,","My heart is sore:","I never shall find it,","Ah, nevermore!"]},{"k":"v","lines":["Save I have him near,","The grave is here;","The world is gall","And bitterness all."]},{"k":"v","lines":["My poor weak head","Is racked and crazed;","My thought is lost,","My senses mazed."]},{"k":"v","lines":["My peace is gone,","My heart is sore:","I never shall find it,","Ah, nevermore!"]},{"k":"v","lines":["To see him, him only,","At the pane I sit;","To meet him, him only,","The house I quit."]},{"k":"v","lines":["His lofty gait,","His noble size,","The smile of his mouth,","The power of his eyes,"]},{"k":"v","lines":["And the magic flow","Of his talk, the bliss","In the clasp of his hand,","And, ah! his kiss!"]},{"k":"v","lines":["My peace is gone,","My heart is sore:","I never shall find it,","Ah, nevermore!"]},{"k":"v","lines":["My bosom yearns","For him alone;","Ah, dared I clasp him,","And hold, and own!"]},{"k":"v","lines":["And kiss his mouth,","To heart’s desire,","And on his kisses","At last expire!"]}]}